3389
02:58:35,090 --> 02:58:36,990
do you think, you know the Mandela effect?

3390
02:58:36,990 --> 02:58:37,830
Yeah.

3391
02:58:37,830 --> 02:58:41,230
So this idea that a lot of people in the 90s

3392
02:58:41,230 --> 02:58:42,930
thought that Mandela died in prison,

3393
02:58:42,930 --> 02:58:45,490
which he obviously didn't, you know?

3394
02:58:45,490 --> 02:58:49,410
Do you think that reality might work more like that

3395
02:58:49,410 --> 02:58:50,250
than we think?

3396
02:58:50,250 --> 02:58:54,110
And so certain mystical experiences happen

3397
02:58:54,110 --> 02:58:57,490
and the people with eyes to see and ears to hear

3398
02:58:57,490 --> 02:58:59,690
experience it and then other people walk away

3399
02:58:59,690 --> 02:59:01,470
