3400
02:59:01,470 --> 02:59:04,130
it happened or whatever, or they like,

3401
02:59:04,130 --> 02:59:08,150
we'll superimpose some prosaic explanation upon the thing.

3402
02:59:08,150 --> 02:59:11,890
And reality itself is far more fractured, malleable,

3403
02:59:11,890 --> 02:59:14,770
and in the eye of the beholder than what it is.

3404
02:59:14,770 --> 02:59:16,010
Yeah, and it's changing.

3405
02:59:16,010 --> 02:59:18,810
It's constantly changing like the Mandela effect

3406
02:59:18,810 --> 02:59:19,830
you talked about.

3407
02:59:19,830 --> 02:59:23,200
One thing that surprised me is my wife

3408
02:59:23,200 --> 02:59:26,240
and I've been married 43 years, right?

3409
02:59:26,240 --> 02:59:28,860
So our honeymoon was in New York City.

3410
02:59:28,860 --> 02:59:31,260
We'd never been there, either one of us.

3411
