We had a plan.

3412
02:59:32,860 --> 02:59:35,300
We wanted to see the train station,

3413
02:59:35,300 --> 02:59:37,280
Grand Central Station, right?

3414
02:59:37,280 --> 02:59:39,000
So we go to Grand Central Station

3415
02:59:39,000 --> 02:59:42,100
and we get photos and videos and we took a helicopter ride

3416
02:59:42,100 --> 02:59:45,180
and we did all kind of things to experience New York.

3417
02:59:46,550 --> 02:59:49,030
And so I'm looking at my old photos

3418
02:59:49,030 --> 02:59:52,080
of Grand Central Station, right?

3419
02:59:52,080 --> 02:59:53,900
Well, Google it now.

3420
02:59:53,900 --> 02:59:56,600
It's not called that, it's called Grand Central Terminal

3421
