and it says it's never been called that.

3422
02:59:59,380 --> 03:00:02,000
But yet I got photos of Grand Central Station.

3423
03:00:02,000 --> 03:00:02,840
Yeah.

3424
03:00:02,840 --> 03:00:03,660
Written on the thing.

3425
03:00:03,660 --> 03:00:04,500
Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.

3426
03:00:04,500 --> 03:00:07,420
But you see it now, it says Grand Central Terminal.

3427
03:00:07,420 --> 03:00:09,260
What's that about?

3428
03:00:09,260 --> 03:00:12,420
Well, you know, the Flintstones,

3429
03:00:12,420 --> 03:00:15,480
the Berenstys, Berenstein Bears,

3430
03:00:15,480 --> 03:00:18,820
all these things where people swear

3431
03:00:18,820 --> 03:00:20,880
that, you know, it was like one way

3432
03:00:20,880 --> 03:00:22,600
and then you look at the record

3433
03:00:22,600 --> 03:00:24,520
and it actually looks like there's another way.

3434
03:00:24,520 --> 03:00:25,360
Yeah.

3435
03:00:25,360 --> 03:00:29,280
And, you know, it is this really amazing phenomena.

3436
03:00:29,280 --> 03:00:30,920
And then you get into deeper studies,

3437
03:00:30,920 --> 03:00:32,000
like there's this neuroscience.

3438
03:00:32,000 --> 03:00:34,340
I mean, you know, there's a scientist, Wilder Penfield,

3439
03:00:34,340 --> 03:00:38,380
and you realize that there is no way of distinguishing

3440
03:00:38,380 --> 03:00:40,780
between false memories and true memories.

3441
03:00:40,780 --> 03:00:42,900
And he shows this with the ability

3442
03:00:42,900 --> 03:00:45,340
to implant false memories into mice and stuff.

3443
03:00:46,480 --> 03:00:48,800
And then you get, if there are these beings

3444
03:00:48,800 --> 03:00:51,060
and any thoughts can be sort of implanted,

3445
03:00:51,060 --> 03:00:53,480
you get into really weird ontological territory

3446
03:00:53,480 --> 03:00:57,380
where the past, and even Schrodinger himself would say,

3447
03:00:57,380 --> 03:00:59,200
a particle is measured in the present,

3448
03:00:59,200 --> 03:01:01,840
you know, it might change its past.

3449
03:01:01,840 --> 03:01:02,680
Right.

3450
03:01:02,680 --> 03:01:05,240
And you get into retrocausality in quantum mechanics.

3451
03:01:05,240 --> 03:01:07,440
There's obviously spooky action at a distance,

3452
03:01:07,440 --> 03:01:09,720
but there's also spooky action across time.

3453
03:01:09,720 --> 03:01:10,560
Right.

3454
03:01:10,560 --> 03:01:15,040
It seems like if you have two entangled photons

3455
03:01:15,040 --> 03:01:17,880
and two double slit experiments run with those,

3456
03:01:17,880 --> 03:01:19,020
you know, entangled photons,

3457
03:01:19,020 --> 03:01:21,180
seems like photon B that you're doing the experiment

3458
03:01:21,180 --> 03:01:22,440
with two days in the future,

3459
03:01:22,440 --> 03:01:24,720
if you measure that and you don't measure the first one,

3460
03:01:24,720 --> 03:01:26,400
the measurement of the one in the future

3461
03:01:26,400 --> 03:01:29,320
is affecting the one of the measurement in the past.

3462
03:01:29,320 --> 03:01:30,160
Exactly.

3463
03:01:30,160 --> 03:01:31,840
There's a great book called Biocentrism,

3464
03:01:31,840 --> 03:01:34,580
that this guy Robert Lanza writes about this stuff.

3465
03:01:34,580 --> 03:01:36,460
So you get into really trippy territory

3466
03:01:36,460 --> 03:01:39,350
where the past becomes,

3467
03:01:39,350 --> 03:01:41,990
the present is this constricted present,

3468
03:01:41,990 --> 03:01:44,970
but it's like an hourglass where you have probable futures

3469
03:01:44,970 --> 03:01:46,250
and probable pasts.

3470
03:01:46,250 --> 03:01:47,090
Right.

3471
03:01:47,090 --> 03:01:48,850
And the present is this measurement sensor

3472
03:01:48,850 --> 03:01:52,030
that is single line of code updating the past

3473
03:01:52,030 --> 03:01:54,310
and maybe updating the future at the same time.

3474
03:01:54,310 --> 03:01:55,150
Right.

3475
03:01:55,150 --> 03:01:57,510
And it's this very strange sort of model,

3476
03:01:57,510 --> 03:02:01,350
but there's no real way to argue against that

3477
03:02:01,350 --> 03:02:02,910
other than physical artifacts.

3478
03:02:02,910 --> 03:02:05,590
So if you have physical artifacts around an event happening,

3479
03:02:05,590 --> 03:02:07,170
you can argue, say this is evidence

3480
03:02:07,170 --> 03:02:10,170
that this happened this way or this happened another way.

3481
03:02:10,170 --> 03:02:12,230
If you have conflicting physical artifacts

3482
03:02:12,230 --> 03:02:14,550
where you don't have physical artifacts,

3483
03:02:14,550 --> 03:02:17,870
it's totally one word against the other word

3484
03:02:17,870 --> 03:02:19,910
or you can get into like numbers of people

3485
03:02:19,910 --> 03:02:20,950
who believe one thing

3486
03:02:20,950 --> 03:02:22,630
or numbers of people that believe another thing.

3487
03:02:22,630 --> 03:02:25,710
But we have no idea how reality works.

3488
03:02:25,710 --> 03:02:27,130
We have no idea.

3489
03:02:27,130 --> 03:02:31,130
We have a very limited, we are measurement sensors.

3490
03:02:31,130 --> 03:02:34,270
And so this idea that science

3491
