like no, it's the map, it's not the territory.

3493
03:02:39,350 --> 03:02:40,190
Exactly.

3494
03:02:40,190 --> 03:02:43,950
It's just we see very limited scopes of reality.

3495
03:02:43,950 --> 03:02:44,790
Right.

3496
03:02:44,790 --> 03:02:46,450
And time is the weirdest thing of all.

3497
